          "line_end": 63,
          "line_start": 63,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "arfo-du-blo/cursor-in-browser",
          "url": "https://github.com/Arfo-du-blo/cursor-in-browser/blob/a86ef5f7c0f4e0304e7488a91914694d63460537/README.md#L63-L63"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_4d66b766b35ea58915bb628a5124a7263822e82ca8540fa0734e74d8c550c314"
      ],
      "text": "Image tags encode Cursor version and CPU architecture, e.g. latest-x64, latest-arm64, or a pinned version like 1.2.3-x64."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_469e42d86c416f7a1f82c0dcda63f18cdc1147d25341b6d50a1d9a4f947585ef",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a86ef5f7c0f4e0304e7488a91914694d63460537",
          "git_sha": "b6779482ff5d5a90f003c8827256eee4517956c4",
          "line_end": 7,
          "line_start": 7,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "arfo-du-blo/cursor-in-browser",
          "url": "https://github.com/Arfo-du-blo/cursor-in-browser/blob/a86ef5f7c0f4e0304e7488a91914694d63460537/README.md#L7-L7"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_f708c7538e26d403ee4e2b66d35ddb76ebdf96773426f4597307899d2c6276a3"
      ],
      "text": "The image packages Cursor; all x64 and arm64 Cursor versions from 0.47.7 onward are available, and the latest tag tracks the newest Cursor release."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1df9617b3b8875a3183b2cc1246e4ff6104bcad1115cb76eae5c3f160ae244f3",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a86ef5f7c0f4e0304e7488a91914694d63460537",
          "git_sha": "b6779482ff5d5a90f003c8827256eee4517956c4",
          "line_end": 9,
          "line_start": 9,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "arfo-du-blo/cursor-in-browser",
          "url": "https://github.com/Arfo-du-blo/cursor-in-browser/blob/a86ef5f7c0f4e0304e7488a91914694d63460537/README.md#L9-L9"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_97f36db007f25d7549c33110a325741861da4a39988c3684020b2adbaa519fe6"
      ],
      "text": "Versioned Cursor builds with required files are stored in a cursor_versions folder, and root Dockerfiles target the latest Cursor version via an API call to Cursor's download endpoint."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_7ae78ebd74cc346bd53a0993c5bab5b79adfa60b65f4ae2cfea7fe730dc2fb22",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a86ef5f7c0f4e0304e7488a91914694d63460537",
          "git_sha": "b6779482ff5d5a90f003c8827256eee4517956c4",
          "line_end": 67,
          "line_start": 67,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "arfo-du-blo/cursor-in-browser",
          "url": "https://github.com/Arfo-du-blo/cursor-in-browser/blob/a86ef5f7c0f4e0304e7488a91914694d63460537/README.md#L67-L67"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2b02b012be62c62c1bb9749b096ad16a2418ba57f6e59ef6e528bc848304efc7"
      ],
      "text": "Due to browser sandbox restrictions, some buttons like Log in cannot be clicked directly; a popup shows external URLs so users can copy them into a new tab."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_47d9e5faa4311d3ae0fbd10983330c6047dd0d9e00a64cfc4ac5d1690d0c1ef9",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a86ef5f7c0f4e0304e7488a91914694d63460537",
          "git_sha": "b6779482ff5d5a90f003c8827256eee4517956c4",
          "line_end": 69,
          "line_start": 69,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "arfo-du-blo/cursor-in-browser",
          "url": "https://github.com/Arfo-du-blo/cursor-in-browser/blob/a86ef5f7c0f4e0304e7488a91914694d63460537/README.md#L69-L69"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_713460dbd3f7fe3aff15a87ed8aecf5bdcdf23873cb00b18d12f4090bdd1ce00"
      ],
      "text": "Closing Cursor leaves a black screen; users must right-click it and select the Cursor entry from the appearing menu to reopen the editor."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_b04b47561fb4f08f1ed08ff4f942e83244e22933a8c12dafd4db44914301e616",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "a86ef5f7c0f4e0304e7488a91914694d63460537",
          "git_sha": "b6779482ff5d5a90f003c8827256eee4517956c4",
          "line_end": 87,
          "line_start": 73,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "arfo-du-blo/cursor-in-browser",
          "url": "https://github.com/Arfo-du-blo/cursor-in-browser/blob/a86ef5f7c0f4e0304e7488a91914694d63460537/README.md#L73-L87"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_cf3707911bfbd42fe9d46b4d9f488133cd662a12f5d14a6fca6f4ff519482bc0"
      ],
      "text": "Configurable environment variables include PUID and PGID (default 911), TZ (default Etc/UTC), and DOCKER_MODS for adding mods such as universal-git."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_7ac2c15ad361e20923a29a2c9b38a13c4816992894a5413899256e87870e6e7f",
